# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 03 IMMEDIATE-OR-CANCEL
# IOC matches what it can immediately; any remainder is cancelled and it never rests on the book.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PLACE 1 A SELL LIMIT 100 5 GTC
PLACE 2 B SELL LIMIT 101 5 GTC
# Partial IOC: 5@100 fills, 101 is beyond the limit -> 3 cancelled.
PLACE 3 C BUY LIMIT 100 8 IOC
STATUS 3
DEPTH
# Non-marketable IOC: nothing fills, all cancelled, book unchanged.
PLACE 4 C BUY LIMIT 99 5 IOC
STATUS 4
# Fully filled IOC: no cancel event at all.
PLACE 5 D BUY LIMIT 101 5 IOC
STATUS 5
# IOC sweeping several levels.
PLACE 6 E BUY LIMIT 50 4 GTC
PLACE 7 F BUY LIMIT 49 4 GTC
PLACE 8 G SELL LIMIT 49 10 IOC      # 4@50, 4@49, 2 cancelled
TOP
# An IOC is never cancellable afterwards: it is already terminal.
CANCEL 3
CANCEL 5